        "original_id": "2091b10d-dd6c-5d54-923c-cc5aea727c90",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anthony Callea, Simon & Garfunkel, Roy Halee\n- Songs: Rain, Bridge over Troubled Water, The Boxer\n- Albums: Anthony Callea\n- Events: Australian Idol series two\n\nFacts:\n- Simon & Garfunkel and Roy Halee produced the song \"Bridge over Troubled Water.\"\n- \"Bridge over Troubled Water\" was released in January 1970 as the follow-up single to \"The Boxer.\"\n- Anthony Callea was the runner-up of Australian Idol series two.\n- Anthony Callea performed \"Bridge over Troubled Water\" on Australian Idol.\n- \"Rain\" was the second song released by Anthony Callea.\n- \"Rain\" appears on Anthony Callea's 2005 self-titled debut album \"Anthony Callea.\"\n- \"Rain\" was released as a double A-side with Anthony Callea's recording of \"Bridge over Troubled Water.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
